  "scope": "Safe Rust translation of arithmetic-index libc++ make_heap + sort_heap fallback, custom descending score comparator scores[a] > scores[b].",
  "details": [
    "make_heap builds an odd prefix with assume_both_children then calls sift_up on the full range.",
    "Equal scores follow exact original move decisions; no stable-index tie break.",
    "pop_heap uses Floyd sift-down then optional prefix sift-up, including the original hole==last branch.",
    "Omitted empty/one-element no-op internal calls do not change index order.",
    "Caller validates finite scores and valid index range."
  ]
